# Formative Assessment 6: Discrimination and Classification (LDA and QDA)

## Dataset Source
UCI Machine Learning Repository — Seeds Dataset: https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/236/seeds (210 observations across Kama, Rosa, and Canadian wheat varieties; 7 continuous geometrical predictors).

## Description of Analysis
Explores the 7 geometrical wheat kernel variables, checks univariate/multivariate normality and Box's M-test for covariance homogeneity, fits LDA and QDA on an identical 70/30 stratified split (`random_state=42`), and evaluates test and 5-fold stratified cross-validation performance (accuracy, misclassification rate, and one-versus-rest sensitivity and specificity).

## Instructions for Reproducing Results
1. Open `Formative_Assessment_6_LDA_QDA.ipynb` in Google Colab (or Jupyter).
2. Optionally place `seeds_dataset.txt` in the working directory (the notebook also includes the exact 210-row dataset fallback).
3. Run all cells sequentially from top to bottom (`random_state=42`).
